This product bundles Unicode Character Database (UCD), Unicode Security
Mechanisms and Unicode Emoji data, version 18.0, published by Unicode, Inc.
(https://www.unicode.org/Public/):

  * opennlp/tools/tokenize/uax29/WordBreakProperty.txt is the upstream
    WordBreakProperty-18.0.0.txt, unmodified except for the file name.
  * opennlp/tools/util/normalizer/confusables.txt is the upstream
    confusables.txt from the Unicode Security Mechanisms (UTS #39),
    version 18.0.0, unmodified.
  * opennlp/tools/util/normalizer/CaseFolding.txt is the upstream
    CaseFolding.txt (version 18.0.0) from the UCD, unmodified.
  * opennlp/tools/tokenize/uax29/ExtendedPictographic.txt keeps only the
    Extended_Pictographic lines of the upstream emoji-data.txt (Emoji Data for
    UTS #51, version 18.0).
  * opennlp/tools/util/normalizer/EmojiSequences.txt is a generated inventory
    of the fully-qualified and minimally-qualified emoji sequences from
    emoji-test.txt and the Emoji_Component ranges from emoji-data.txt, both
    Unicode Emoji 18.0:
    https://www.unicode.org/Public/18.0.0/emoji/emoji-test.txt
    https://www.unicode.org/Public/18.0.0/ucd/emoji/emoji-data.txt

The project-authored annotation table
opennlp/tools/util/normalizer/emoji-annotations.txt is licensed under the
Apache License 2.0. It is an independent project comment table (not a full
Unicode Emoji inventory); CLDR short names and entity-type/category
derivations were transcribed from emoji-test.txt (version 18.0). Sentiment
scores are original project judgments.

